Package: hermiteStats
Type: Package
Title: Distribution-Robust Statistics via Hermite Polynomial Quantile Modeling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Wolfgang", "Lenhard", email = "wolfgang.lenhard@uni-wuerzburg.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2321-7299")),
    person("Alexandra", "Lenhard", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Provides distribution-robust estimators of the Pearson correlation 
    coefficient (Hermite-Mehler correlation) and standardized mean differences 
    (distribution-free effect size d_reg) using rank-based inverse-normal scores, 
    monotone polynomial quantile modeling, and analytical moment extraction via 
    orthogonal Probabilists' Hermite polynomials and Mehler's identity.
